            "description": "Watch Sporting JAX vs Detroit City highlights and goals from USL Championship on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on June 13, 2026. The USL Championship atmosphere was electric as Sporting JAX prepared to face Detroit City in a highly anticipated mid-season clash. Both teams entered the pitch with everything to play for, promising a spectacle for the fans in attendance. Physical Battle and Clinical Finishing The second half of this fixture on 2026-06-13 began with a surge of physical intensity. Detroit City showed their aggression early on, with both A. Diouf and D. Amoo-Mensah receiving yellow cards within the first eleven minutes of the restart. Despite the disciplinary pressure, the visitors remained clinical in front of goal. In the 57th minute, D. Smith found the back of the net after a precise assist from T. E. Preston , pushing the scoreline to 1-4 in favor of the away side. Sporting JAX Fights Back Sporting JAX refused to surrender without a fight and looked for a way back into the contest. After W. Kuzain was cautioned in the 65th minute, the home side found a spark of hope. K. Sadlier managed to reduce the deficit in the 69th minute, clinically finishing a chance created by E. Jaaskelainen . The goal briefly shifted the momentum, as the home fans rallied behind their team in hopes of an improbable comeback. Detroit City Seals the Result Any lingering hopes of a recovery were extinguished in the final ten minutes of play. D. Smith secured his brace in the 81st minute, assisted by K. Hernandez-Foster , to restore a three-goal cushion. Following a series of late bookings for C. Rutz and A. Gomez , Detroit City added a final flourish. In stoppage time, K. Hernandez-Foster turned from provider to scorer, netting in the 93rd minute to conclude a dominant 2-6 performance on the road."
